versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

title:
Demo facility entity for UI testing and demonstration purposes.

This type represents a simplified facility model used in the Asset Performance UI library
for testing organizational structures and facility-based filtering.


// Create a demo facility
UiApDemoFacility.make({
  name: "Plant Alpha"
}).create()

// Create another facility
UiApDemoFacility.make({
  name: "Plant Beta"
}).create()
